WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.800 --> 01:43.020
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.680
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.680 --> 01:45.910
[Episode 27]

5
03:20.800 --> 03:21.960
Father.

6
03:42.030 --> 03:42.840
Your Majesty.

7
03:43.400 --> 03:44.960
The Fourth Prince is here.

8
03:50.910 --> 03:51.770
Fourth Prince,

9
03:52.360 --> 03:54.220
pay your respects to His Majesty.

10
04:00.510 --> 04:03.330
I, Li Si, Divine Constable Qingyang,

11
04:04.560 --> 04:06.360
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

12
04:10.590 --> 04:11.400
Yan?

13
04:15.170 --> 04:16.320
Is that Yan?

14
04:17.560 --> 04:18.630
You're back?

15
04:19.760 --> 04:20.570
Yes.

16
04:23.250 --> 04:24.610
I'm back.

17
04:31.920 --> 04:32.830
It's good.

18
04:36.950 --> 04:38.680
It's good that you're home now.

19
04:45.870 --> 04:47.670
I remember when you were little,

20
04:49.560 --> 04:51.310
you always played so wildly,

21
04:53.120 --> 04:54.270
and I always

22
04:55.720 --> 04:57.360
had to look for you

23
04:57.360 --> 04:58.760
all over Tianhuang City.

24
05:00.720 --> 05:02.480
But no matter where you hid,

25
05:03.240 --> 05:05.190
I could always find you.

26
05:09.080 --> 05:11.640
This was the only time I ever lost you,

27
05:15.070 --> 05:18.000
and it's been 17 years since then.

28
05:20.120 --> 05:20.920
Yan,

29
05:21.950 --> 05:23.120
where on earth

30
05:23.950 --> 05:25.120
have you been hiding

31
05:26.560 --> 05:29.270
all these years by yourself?

32
05:31.480 --> 05:32.390
Father.

33
05:34.430 --> 05:35.510
The world is vast,

34
05:36.480 --> 05:38.409
and there is always a place to stay.

35
05:39.120 --> 05:40.310
I've roamed jianghu

36
05:41.120 --> 05:42.310
and done business,

37
05:43.490 --> 05:44.720
going through

38
05:44.830 --> 05:45.720
ups and downs.

39
05:47.100 --> 05:48.760
It hasn't been a waste of time.

40
06:22.870 --> 06:23.800
Get up. Hurry.

41
06:37.120 --> 06:38.120
How did you

42
06:41.560 --> 06:43.800
grow up so fast?

43
07:00.330 --> 07:01.090
Father,

44
07:01.720 --> 07:02.920
for 17 years,

45
07:04.710 --> 07:07.240
I have never fulfilled my filial duties.

46
07:08.510 --> 07:10.120
I've come back too late

47
07:11.530 --> 07:13.130
and caused you so much worry.

48
07:13.880 --> 07:15.150
It's my fault.

49
07:26.310 --> 07:29.670
Do you know how much I missed you?

50
07:35.159 --> 07:37.860
I missed you so much!

51
07:41.159 --> 07:43.159
Yan!

52
07:45.330 --> 07:47.250
Yan!

53
08:19.070 --> 08:20.870
Who made a mess

54
08:21.040 --> 08:22.540
of my Imperial Study?

55
08:22.720 --> 08:23.590
Father.

56
08:25.190 --> 08:25.870
Look,

57
08:25.870 --> 08:27.910
I planted a little tree.

58
08:29.120 --> 08:30.070
Let me ask you.

59
08:30.270 --> 08:31.160
One big, one small,

60
08:31.160 --> 08:32.320
one tall, one short—

61
08:32.470 --> 08:34.270
how does that fit with the royal way

62
08:34.270 --> 08:36.669
of impartiality, balance, and propriety?

63
08:36.870 --> 08:38.200
I don't care about

64
08:38.200 --> 08:39.530
harmony or moderation.

65
08:39.549 --> 08:41.080
I just think,

66
08:41.080 --> 08:42.150
with one big tree

67
08:42.150 --> 08:44.510
standing all alone in this Imperial Study,

68
08:44.510 --> 08:46.440
it would be lonely.

69
08:52.720 --> 08:55.910
Let me see your dirty little face.

70
08:57.390 --> 08:58.200
Come on.

71
09:03.100 --> 09:03.900
Yan.

72
09:11.510 --> 09:13.240
Let's have this little tree...

73
09:16.670 --> 09:17.480
stay with the big tree forever.

74
09:17.480 --> 09:18.870
How about that?

75
09:23.960 --> 09:25.010
Alright.

76
09:31.270 --> 09:32.110
Come on.

77
09:32.430 --> 09:34.030
I'll plant it with you.

78
10:10.240 --> 10:11.030
At first,

79
10:11.840 --> 10:13.270
I was abducted

80
10:13.630 --> 10:14.830
and couldn't return.

81
10:17.320 --> 10:19.080
Later, when I grew up a bit,

82
10:19.910 --> 10:21.570
I thought that returning then

83
10:21.960 --> 10:23.620
might destabilize the court,

84
10:25.240 --> 10:27.440
so I decided to uncover the truth first.

85
10:37.270 --> 10:39.670
I already know what your eldest

86
10:40.750 --> 10:42.480
and second brothers have done.

87
10:46.910 --> 10:48.270
But besides them,

88
10:48.510 --> 10:49.390
there was someone behind it

89
10:49.390 --> 10:50.720
who abducted me.

90
10:51.270 --> 10:53.400
They must have had an ulterior motive.

91
10:53.440 --> 10:54.240
Therefore,

92
10:54.910 --> 10:57.080
I had to get to the bottom of it.

93
10:58.720 --> 10:59.480
The reason

94
10:59.480 --> 11:01.030
I chose to return now

95
11:01.550 --> 11:02.480
is that

96
11:02.670 --> 11:04.670
the sixth mural in Tianshu Pavilion

97
11:04.750 --> 11:06.410
is on the verge of shattering.

98
11:07.150 --> 11:08.810
I was afraid Liluo's curse...

99
11:11.080 --> 11:12.270
would come true.

100
11:14.720 --> 11:16.320
You've been through so much.

101
11:16.440 --> 11:18.030
You're still my good child,

102
11:18.510 --> 11:20.080
just as you always were.

103
11:22.960 --> 11:25.030
But I'm old now.

104
11:25.120 --> 11:27.270
I can no longer bear

105
11:27.910 --> 11:29.440
the burden on my shoulders.

106
11:29.750 --> 11:31.480
I can only pass it on to you.

107
11:42.030 --> 11:42.840
Father,

108
11:43.960 --> 11:44.840
rest assured.

109
11:45.480 --> 11:46.080
Now

110
11:46.080 --> 11:47.840
that I've returned as Zhou Yan,

111
11:48.720 --> 11:49.910
I won't let those

112
11:49.910 --> 11:51.510
with malicious intentions

113
11:52.840 --> 11:54.030
get what they want.

114
11:57.120 --> 11:58.580
All the memories are back.

115
11:59.150 --> 11:59.960
Father,

116
12:00.030 --> 12:01.870
even if I were wronged,

117
12:01.470 --> 12:05.470
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

118
12:01.870 --> 12:03.030
it wouldn't matter.

119
12:03.030 --> 12:05.240
All I want is for you not to go gray.

120
12:05.240 --> 12:05.910
Alright.

121
12:06.270 --> 12:07.270
I grant your wish.

122
12:07.270 --> 12:08.320
A ruler never goes back on his word.

123
12:08.320 --> 12:09.080
Pinky swear.

124
12:09.320 --> 12:10.630
A ruler never goes back on his word.

125
12:10.630 --> 12:11.790
I promise you.

126
12:22.440 --> 12:25.320
Crown Prince, Zhou Tiao, has violated moral principles

127
12:25.320 --> 12:26.870
and shown himself unworthy.

128
12:25.400 --> 12:28.580
[Shi]

129
12:27.320 --> 12:28.840
He is to be confined to his residence

130
12:28.840 --> 12:30.170
and forbidden to leave.

131
12:31.080 --> 12:34.270
Prince Ding, Zhou Miao, colluded with foreign enemies

132
12:34.750 --> 12:36.390
and harmed his own kin.

133
12:36.720 --> 12:38.080
Effective today,

134
12:38.670 --> 12:40.670
he is stripped of his princely title

135
12:40.910 --> 12:42.630
and demoted to a commoner.

136
12:43.240 --> 12:44.900
Zhou Yan, by imperial decree,

137
12:44.910 --> 12:46.910
I hereby bestow upon you the title of Prince Xian

138
12:46.910 --> 12:48.790
and the imperial seal.

139
12:49.480 --> 12:50.910
You are granted seven pearls,

140
12:50.910 --> 12:53.850
thereby placing you above all other princes and nobles.

141
12:53.850 --> 12:55.540
So ordered!

142
13:05.140 --> 13:12.170
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents, Shen Baoquan and Guan] [Tomb of Shen Lan]

143
13:26.270 --> 13:27.080
Lan,

144
13:32.240 --> 13:33.840
I have failed you.

145
13:36.720 --> 13:38.580
If I'd agreed to fly kites with you

146
13:40.630 --> 13:42.090
in the mountains that day,

147
13:43.270 --> 13:45.400
we would have gone far away and hidden,

148
13:48.720 --> 13:50.250
and you wouldn't have died.

149
14:12.870 --> 14:14.880
[Tomb of Shen Lan]

150
14:17.510 --> 14:18.320
Shen Lan,

151
14:19.840 --> 14:21.300
you've finally come home.

152
15:32.730 --> 15:35.750
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents, Shen Baoquan and Guan]

153
16:15.730 --> 16:18.760
♪ Capture my heart ♪

154
16:19.290 --> 16:22.520
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

155
16:23.540 --> 16:28.940
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

156
16:29.490 --> 16:32.520
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

157
16:32.910 --> 16:33.720
Meng Rui.

158
16:33.380 --> 16:36.540
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

159
16:35.080 --> 16:35.910
Your father,

160
16:36.750 --> 16:37.550
mother,

161
16:37.610 --> 16:43.550
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

162
16:38.440 --> 16:39.570
and younger brother

163
16:40.720 --> 16:42.080
all died because of me.

164
16:43.840 --> 16:44.910
I'm afraid

165
16:43.920 --> 16:46.980
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

166
16:46.270 --> 16:47.240
I'll never be able to repay what I owe you

167
16:47.240 --> 16:48.390
in this lifetime.

168
16:47.800 --> 16:50.900
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

169
16:49.550 --> 16:51.550
The ones who killed my entire family

170
16:51.570 --> 16:57.280
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

171
16:53.240 --> 16:54.630
were the Liluo people.

172
16:57.890 --> 17:00.970
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

173
17:00.630 --> 17:01.440
Li Si.

174
17:01.640 --> 17:04.640
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

175
17:02.720 --> 17:04.920
Since you know Lan died for you,

176
17:06.000 --> 17:11.980
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

177
17:06.069 --> 17:07.109
from now on,

178
17:07.550 --> 17:09.550
you must take good care of yourself.

179
17:09.829 --> 17:10.750
Don't keep feeling

180
17:10.750 --> 17:12.270
indebted to others.

181
17:12.170 --> 17:15.240
♪ Dare not forget ♪

182
17:12.510 --> 17:14.310
Otherwise, Lan won't be able

183
17:15.960 --> 17:17.030
to rest in peace.

184
17:15.990 --> 17:19.270
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

185
17:20.089 --> 17:25.640
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

186
17:26.380 --> 17:29.330
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

187
17:29.800 --> 17:33.160
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

188
17:33.750 --> 17:40.500
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

189
17:38.720 --> 17:39.780
So you had this half

190
17:40.830 --> 17:41.920
all along?

191
17:42.710 --> 17:46.670
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

192
17:49.740 --> 17:54.250
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

193
17:57.460 --> 18:03.140
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents, Shen Baoquan and Guan] [Tomb of Shen Lan]

194
18:32.550 --> 18:33.550
Prince Xian.

195
18:40.940 --> 18:42.020
Prince Xian.

196
18:43.720 --> 18:44.750
Are you here to mock your brother,

197
18:44.750 --> 18:46.550
who's now a commoner?

198
18:47.820 --> 18:48.890
Do you remember

199
18:50.560 --> 18:51.920
the story you used to beg me to tell you

200
18:51.920 --> 18:53.350
when we were children?

201
18:58.400 --> 18:59.800
What was the story about?

202
19:01.790 --> 19:02.880
You only ever told me one story,

203
19:02.880 --> 19:03.880
Brother.

204
19:04.590 --> 19:05.510
It was about

205
19:06.960 --> 19:10.070
how Father met your birth mother,

206
19:10.510 --> 19:11.920
Lady Hu,

207
19:12.680 --> 19:13.940
here in Mount Dahuang.

208
19:16.550 --> 19:17.480
Once upon a time,

209
19:17.840 --> 19:19.990
a nobleman and a country girl

210
19:20.160 --> 19:21.830
fell in love.

211
19:22.400 --> 19:24.130
Father loved my mother dearly,

212
19:24.510 --> 19:25.830
but their social standing

213
19:25.830 --> 19:27.110
was worlds apart.

214
19:27.790 --> 19:28.510
Back then,

215
19:28.510 --> 19:30.590
Father was still living in his princely residence.

216
19:30.590 --> 19:32.270
He feared

217
19:32.350 --> 19:33.920
angering Grandfather,

218
19:34.270 --> 19:36.530
so he never gave my mother a proper title.

219
19:37.510 --> 19:39.440
After Father ascended the throne,

220
19:39.510 --> 19:41.710
he couldn't afford to invite criticism

221
19:42.070 --> 19:44.670
because the realm had only just been pacified,

222
19:45.140 --> 19:47.740
so he failed to bring Lady Hu back to the palace.

223
19:48.070 --> 19:49.550
By the time the court had stabilized

224
19:49.550 --> 19:50.310
and he was finally ready

225
19:50.310 --> 19:51.920
to bring her back,

226
19:53.920 --> 19:55.650
she'd already died of illness.

227
20:00.880 --> 20:02.030
I told you,

228
20:05.000 --> 20:06.000
"Fourth Brother,

229
20:06.790 --> 20:07.720
if my mother had still been alive

230
20:07.720 --> 20:08.960
back then,

231
20:09.720 --> 20:11.880
your mother might not have been

232
20:12.510 --> 20:14.570
the most favored woman in the harem."

233
20:17.550 --> 20:18.510
To be honest,

234
20:20.480 --> 20:22.280
I really believed it at the time.

235
20:22.550 --> 20:23.550
But later,

236
20:24.880 --> 20:26.750
I searched through the imperial genealogy

237
20:26.750 --> 20:27.750
and couldn't find

238
20:27.750 --> 20:29.070
Lady Hu's title.

239
20:30.590 --> 20:31.820
Only then did I realize

240
20:31.820 --> 20:33.210
that what you said

241
20:34.070 --> 20:35.420
might not be true.

242
20:50.200 --> 20:51.550
In her later years, my mother

243
20:51.550 --> 20:53.350
wandered outside the palace,

244
20:54.920 --> 20:56.750
shouting and screaming

245
20:57.670 --> 20:59.070
that she wanted to see me.

246
21:00.350 --> 21:01.480
Outside the palace?

247
21:01.480 --> 21:03.160
Have you ever looked down from atop

248
21:03.160 --> 21:04.750
the Imperial City walls

249
21:05.000 --> 21:06.680
at the beggars

250
21:06.680 --> 21:07.940
on the First Ring Road?

251
21:08.270 --> 21:10.030
I gave them porridge and tea

252
21:10.030 --> 21:11.750
every day.

253
21:11.750 --> 21:12.960
They all said

254
21:13.270 --> 21:15.160
I was a benevolent prince.

255
21:21.200 --> 21:22.860
But let me tell you something.

256
21:23.200 --> 21:24.750
Every single day, I could see

257
21:24.750 --> 21:25.750
my mother

258
21:27.510 --> 21:29.510
just beyond those palace walls.

259
21:29.750 --> 21:31.160
We were only a wall apart.

260
21:31.920 --> 21:33.380
I could never go out to her,

261
21:33.920 --> 21:35.720
and she could never come in to me.

262
21:36.000 --> 21:38.330
So I watched her come back again and again,

263
21:38.550 --> 21:40.310
full of hope,

264
21:40.310 --> 21:41.590
only to leave in sorrow,

265
21:41.590 --> 21:43.160
time after time.

266
21:45.750 --> 21:47.550
She came less and less often.

267
21:48.350 --> 21:49.160
Then one day,

268
21:52.270 --> 21:54.070
she stopped coming altogether.

269
21:56.000 --> 21:58.530
Of course I could have gone out to look for her,

270
21:59.160 --> 22:00.350
but I didn't dare.

271
22:00.370 --> 22:02.230
I was afraid of offending Father.

272
22:04.590 --> 22:05.640
Let me tell you.

273
22:07.000 --> 22:08.240
To this day,

274
22:09.920 --> 22:11.590
I still don't know

275
22:11.720 --> 22:14.110
where my mother is buried.

276
22:16.680 --> 22:18.440
I could have asked around,

277
22:18.960 --> 22:20.510
but I didn't dare!

278
22:21.350 --> 22:22.270
I was afraid

279
22:22.720 --> 22:24.980
Father would remember that I, Zhou Miao,

280
22:25.070 --> 22:25.830
was nothing more

281
22:25.830 --> 22:27.960
than the illegitimate son of a peasant girl he,

282
22:27.960 --> 22:30.110
the great Emperor Dezong, took to bed

283
22:30.110 --> 22:31.750
while drunk.

284
22:33.480 --> 22:35.640
I knew that as an illegitimate son,

285
22:36.070 --> 22:37.350
I never stood a chance

286
22:37.350 --> 22:38.810
of sitting on that throne.

287
22:39.510 --> 22:40.720
I also knew that Father

288
22:40.720 --> 22:42.750
let me cultivate a reputation as a virtuous prince

289
22:42.750 --> 22:43.830
and promoted me

290
22:44.350 --> 22:46.510
only to temper his second son

291
22:46.920 --> 22:47.920
and keep him in check.

292
22:47.920 --> 22:49.070
But what about me?

293
22:49.790 --> 22:51.120
What right does he have?

294
22:51.510 --> 22:52.790
Why?

295
22:53.680 --> 22:55.070
I couldn't accept this.

296
22:55.350 --> 22:56.240
I know

297
22:57.680 --> 22:59.010
you're hurting inside.

298
23:00.310 --> 23:02.510
But no matter how much you've suffered,

299
23:02.720 --> 23:04.680
the people of Mingling

300
23:05.400 --> 23:06.920
and Gutan have suffered far more.

301
23:06.920 --> 23:07.750
You're right!

302
23:09.270 --> 23:10.920
I know the people are suffering.

303
23:10.920 --> 23:12.310
I know I, Zhou Miao,

304
23:12.860 --> 23:14.450
have wronged many people!

305
23:19.830 --> 23:20.760
Fourth Brother,

306
23:22.790 --> 23:24.790
the person I've wronged the most...

307
23:27.160 --> 23:28.190
is you.

308
23:33.500 --> 23:34.750
You know what?

309
23:35.920 --> 23:38.590
The one who arranged the assassination attempt on you back then...

310
23:38.590 --> 23:39.720
was Second Brother.

311
23:40.160 --> 23:40.920
But I was the one

312
23:40.920 --> 23:43.070
who lured Father away

313
23:43.830 --> 23:44.640
that day.

314
23:46.490 --> 23:48.080
Second Brother and I

315
23:49.310 --> 23:50.920
did it together.

316
23:56.810 --> 23:58.810
Since you've admitted it yourself,

317
23:59.860 --> 24:01.790
there's nothing more for me to say.

318
24:15.340 --> 24:16.670
The years are peaceful.

319
24:17.460 --> 24:19.350
Take care of yourself.

320
24:19.680 --> 24:20.840
I don't believe it!

321
24:22.070 --> 24:23.030
I don't believe your heart

322
24:23.030 --> 24:24.070
is that pure!

323
24:24.110 --> 24:26.400
You could've returned at any time,

324
24:26.400 --> 24:27.960
but you chose to come back

325
24:27.960 --> 24:29.350
when Father was gravely ill!

326
24:29.350 --> 24:31.350
You have no ambition for the throne?

327
24:32.270 --> 24:33.240
Impossible!

328
24:33.550 --> 24:35.400
Everyone wants to be the emperor!

329
24:35.400 --> 24:36.350
Why?

330
24:36.350 --> 24:37.310
Why?

331
24:37.510 --> 24:38.400
Why?

332
24:39.350 --> 24:40.830
If you hadn't returned,

333
24:40.960 --> 24:43.350
Father might still have paid some attention to me!

334
24:43.350 --> 24:45.220
Why did you have to come back?

335
24:45.350 --> 24:46.400
Why?

336
24:46.420 --> 24:47.960
I can't accept this!

337
24:48.160 --> 24:49.220
Why?

338
25:04.400 --> 25:06.350
Why did you come back?

339
25:57.310 --> 25:58.170
Your Highness!

340
26:00.310 --> 26:01.230
Your Highness!

341
26:12.960 --> 26:15.490
Seventeen years ago, you found me.

342
26:17.790 --> 26:19.810
Today, it's my turn to find you.

343
26:34.240 --> 26:38.060
[Yu'an Hall]

344
26:39.350 --> 26:40.880
He fell off a cliff and died?

345
26:52.810 --> 26:55.390
I can't believe it.

346
27:01.550 --> 27:02.950
Give him a proper burial.

347
27:04.270 --> 27:05.070
Bury him...

348
27:07.310 --> 27:09.370
Bury him with the honors due a prince.

349
27:11.080 --> 27:12.980
Yes, Your Majesty.

350
27:14.720 --> 27:16.200
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

351
27:16.760 --> 27:18.970
I failed you.

352
27:19.720 --> 27:22.000
We searched for half the day

353
27:22.550 --> 27:23.750
and found only

354
27:23.750 --> 27:26.170
the First Princess Consort's body,

355
27:27.110 --> 27:29.480
but we couldn't find...

356
27:30.350 --> 27:32.710
the First Prince.

357
27:33.130 --> 27:34.050
What?

358
27:35.350 --> 27:37.270
According to Chief Xuanyuan,

359
27:37.880 --> 27:40.340
not even the First Prince's clothes or shoes

360
27:40.350 --> 27:43.920
were found

361
27:45.920 --> 27:48.790
at the bottom of the cliff.

362
27:58.000 --> 27:58.800
Your Majesty!

363
28:00.350 --> 28:01.200
Your Majesty!

364
28:02.480 --> 28:04.340
Summon the imperial physicians!

365
28:04.440 --> 28:05.240
Hurry!

366
28:05.720 --> 28:06.790
Your Majesty!

367
28:07.000 --> 28:10.320
[In the winter of the 37th year of the Hongyun Reign of Great Shi,] -Your Majesty!

368
28:10.320 --> 28:15.110
[Emperor Dezong fell gravely ill and took to his bed.] -Summon the imperial physicians!

369
28:15.110 --> 28:18.030
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees:

370
28:18.350 --> 28:19.720
Effective today,

371
28:19.750 --> 28:22.350
Zhou Zhu is to take command of the Vanguard Camp

372
28:22.350 --> 28:24.400
and station his troops outside Tianhuang City.

373
28:24.400 --> 28:26.400
No entry without imperial summons.

374
28:26.480 --> 28:27.880
No unauthorized departure.

375
28:27.880 --> 28:28.790
Violators

376
28:28.960 --> 28:31.090
shall be punished under military law.

377
28:34.200 --> 28:35.270
Yes, Your Majesty.

378
28:48.110 --> 28:48.920
General,

379
28:49.200 --> 28:51.130
what does His Majesty mean by this?

380
28:51.310 --> 28:52.110
General,

381
28:52.350 --> 28:55.010
His Highness Prince Xian requests an audience.

382
29:34.480 --> 29:35.350
Father has ordered me

383
29:35.350 --> 29:37.310
to take command of the Vanguard Camp

384
29:37.310 --> 29:39.110
and barred me from entering the city.

385
29:39.110 --> 29:40.000
I suspect...

386
29:40.720 --> 29:42.720
he's worried that if he passes away,

387
29:43.350 --> 29:46.350
you won't be able to keep the situation under control.

388
29:46.610 --> 29:47.610
Third Brother.

389
29:49.310 --> 29:51.720
There's something I've always wanted to ask you.

390
29:51.720 --> 29:52.880
Have you ever felt

391
29:54.220 --> 29:56.220
that you've been treated unfairly?

392
29:59.270 --> 30:01.200
You wandered outside for 17 years.

393
30:02.400 --> 30:03.880
Father made amends

394
30:03.880 --> 30:05.880
by making you a Seven-Pearl Prince.

395
30:06.400 --> 30:07.860
I can only be happy for you.

396
30:08.110 --> 30:09.970
Why would I feel that it's unfair?

397
30:10.070 --> 30:12.270
Even without the title of Seven-Pearl Prince,

398
30:12.270 --> 30:13.070
Father

399
30:13.720 --> 30:14.480
has already given me

400
30:14.480 --> 30:16.200
more than enough with the favor

401
30:16.200 --> 30:17.920
he showed me as a child.

402
30:18.200 --> 30:19.660
If anything, you have been

403
30:20.350 --> 30:21.950
the one he treated unfairly.

404
30:22.110 --> 30:22.920
Prince Xian, mind your words.

405
30:22.920 --> 30:23.780
Third Brother,

406
30:30.000 --> 30:31.240
I must say it.

407
30:32.550 --> 30:34.550
You've guarded the border for years

408
30:34.550 --> 30:36.160
and won countless victories.

409
30:36.160 --> 30:37.400
Yet even now,

410
30:38.980 --> 30:41.180
you're still only a commandery prince.

411
30:42.510 --> 30:43.890
You and I have always shared

412
30:43.890 --> 30:45.690
a special bond since childhood.

413
30:46.350 --> 30:47.110
Back then,

414
30:48.200 --> 30:49.860
when news of my death came out,

415
30:50.440 --> 30:51.740
you were the only one

416
30:52.160 --> 30:53.620
among the court officials

417
30:53.750 --> 30:55.550
who sought to uncover the truth.

418
30:55.680 --> 30:56.480
You even

419
30:59.140 --> 31:00.870
defied Father for my sake.

420
31:02.480 --> 31:03.340
Third Brother,

421
31:05.070 --> 31:07.200
I've never forgotten all the kindness

422
31:07.350 --> 31:08.440
you've shown me.

423
31:12.830 --> 31:14.760
Eldest Brother and Second Brother

424
31:16.000 --> 31:17.070
envied me

425
31:17.330 --> 31:18.460
and set traps for me.

426
31:18.790 --> 31:20.450
I don't care about any of that.

427
31:21.400 --> 31:23.000
But I cannot ignore

428
31:23.790 --> 31:25.240
how you feel.

429
31:25.240 --> 31:26.000
Enough.

430
31:32.110 --> 31:32.920
Oh, right.

431
31:34.570 --> 31:36.240
Before you met Father,

432
31:36.310 --> 31:37.110
did Aunt

433
31:38.550 --> 31:39.440
already know

434
31:39.440 --> 31:40.300
your identity?

435
31:42.110 --> 31:43.710
Who else knew it besides her?

436
31:44.920 --> 31:47.520
Your friend from the Divine Constable Bureau,

437
31:48.880 --> 31:49.680
Meng Rui?

438
31:52.750 --> 31:53.550
Meng Rui...

439
31:55.100 --> 31:57.030
Perhaps he had guessed it long ago.

440
31:59.750 --> 32:01.960
If we are talking about feeling wronged,

441
32:01.960 --> 32:03.690
of course I have my grievances.

442
32:04.110 --> 32:05.770
Everyone knew your identity.

443
32:06.110 --> 32:07.270
I, your third brother, was the only one

444
32:07.270 --> 32:09.110
who was too stupid to figure it out

445
32:09.110 --> 32:10.400
until the very end.

446
32:10.920 --> 32:12.450
And in terms of unfairness,

447
32:12.750 --> 32:14.150
Father truly was unfair.

448
32:14.680 --> 32:15.750
He gave you

449
32:15.750 --> 32:17.350
such a brilliant mind,

450
32:18.000 --> 32:19.110
but made me a brute

451
32:19.110 --> 32:19.640
who knows nothing

452
32:19.640 --> 32:21.440
but leading troops into battle.

453
32:24.110 --> 32:24.920
By the way,

454
32:25.270 --> 32:26.000
you've spent years playing nice

455
32:26.000 --> 32:27.260
with the Liluo people.

456
32:28.400 --> 32:30.060
Given how vicious they are...

457
32:30.750 --> 32:32.110
how's your health?

458
32:38.550 --> 32:40.610
Third Brother, who do you take me for?

459
32:40.750 --> 32:42.270
I'm in perfect health.

460
32:42.790 --> 32:44.120
If you don't believe me,

461
32:44.590 --> 32:46.200
why don't we have a little spar,

462
32:46.200 --> 32:47.110
just like we did

463
32:47.160 --> 32:47.960
as children?

464
32:48.400 --> 32:50.480
Young Master Qingyang is famous throughout jianghu.

465
32:50.480 --> 32:51.610
I'm no match for him.

466
32:52.190 --> 32:53.360
I won't fight back.

467
32:53.380 --> 32:54.470
Consider it

468
32:55.600 --> 32:56.980
my apology for keeping the truth from you

469
32:56.980 --> 32:58.110
all these years.

470
33:00.440 --> 33:03.210
♪ I open the door to winds of change ♪

471
33:03.480 --> 33:04.920
I still won't do it.

472
33:04.570 --> 33:07.280
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

473
33:05.310 --> 33:06.840
You're the future emperor.

474
33:06.920 --> 33:07.850
I wouldn't dare.

475
33:08.270 --> 33:10.990
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

476
33:09.640 --> 33:10.440
Come on.

477
33:12.310 --> 33:15.240
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

478
33:15.750 --> 33:17.880
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

479
33:18.380 --> 33:20.220
♪ Never looking away ♪

480
33:20.560 --> 33:22.180
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

481
33:22.620 --> 33:24.300
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

482
33:24.650 --> 33:26.390
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

483
33:26.780 --> 33:28.320
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

484
33:28.620 --> 33:30.280
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

485
33:30.610 --> 33:32.850
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

486
33:32.980 --> 33:35.640
♪ If the moonlight is hidden and the candles burn out ♪

487
33:36.130 --> 33:38.180
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

488
33:41.010 --> 33:43.710
♪ I believe some unseen longing surges within ♪

489
33:43.440 --> 33:44.240
Now,

490
33:44.240 --> 33:46.260
♪ Pulling me along ♪

491
33:45.550 --> 33:48.110
the fate of the nation rests on your shoulders,

492
33:48.110 --> 33:49.710
so you must take good care of yourself.

493
33:49.710 --> 33:52.080
♪ When the moonlight returns, the candle flames burn anew ♪

494
33:50.510 --> 33:52.630
Since I cannot leave the military camp,

495
33:52.630 --> 33:54.630
♪ And I can see myself ♪

496
33:52.790 --> 33:54.250
you should spend more time

497
33:54.920 --> 33:56.320
with Father in the palace

498
33:57.490 --> 34:00.090
♪ It won't betray the fervent longing fate ♪

499
33:58.270 --> 34:00.630
and fulfill the filial duties on my behalf.

500
34:00.630 --> 34:02.160
♪ Once stirred within me ♪

501
34:05.340 --> 34:08.130
♪ After all the twists and turns, through a thousand joys and sorrows ♪

502
34:08.300 --> 34:12.199
♪ I only hope tomorrow finds me still full of courage ♪

503
34:13.100 --> 34:15.030
♪ At daybreak, I'll look back ♪

504
34:15.690 --> 34:20.290
♪ And finally understand why this journey had to be mine ♪

505
34:36.760 --> 34:37.550
Are you done?

506
34:38.110 --> 34:39.000
How is it?

507
34:53.510 --> 34:55.110
Just as I suspected,

508
34:55.360 --> 34:56.560
he died of poisoning.

509
34:57.670 --> 34:59.360
Based on our earlier deductions,

510
34:59.360 --> 35:00.550
the Grand Heir Apparent was already dead

511
35:00.550 --> 35:01.710
before he set out.

512
35:02.000 --> 35:04.000
The Frost Moth was then implanted in his body to preserve it,

513
35:04.000 --> 35:05.400
giving Huo Daozhang time

514
35:05.400 --> 35:06.960
to alter the corpse.

515
35:06.960 --> 35:08.360
Judging by the timeline,

516
35:08.360 --> 35:09.070
the Grand Heir Apparent was likely murdered

517
35:09.070 --> 35:10.550
as soon as he announced he would personally attend

518
35:10.550 --> 35:11.960
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

519
35:11.960 --> 35:12.920
The poison was administered

520
35:12.920 --> 35:14.210
right at the Crown Prince's residence.

521
35:14.210 --> 35:15.210
Whoever did it

522
35:15.330 --> 35:17.190
had precise control over the dosage

523
35:17.190 --> 35:18.590
and timing.

524
35:18.670 --> 35:19.590
Even the slightest difference,

525
35:19.590 --> 35:20.510
whether more or less poison, or a little earlier or later,

526
35:20.510 --> 35:22.040
would have ruined the plan.

527
35:24.110 --> 35:24.920
Qingyang?

528
35:26.070 --> 35:26.880
No.

529
35:27.190 --> 35:29.510
Greetings, Your Highness Prince Xian.

530
35:31.280 --> 35:32.470
Please rise, Yan.

531
35:34.670 --> 35:35.480
Li Si!

532
35:38.190 --> 35:39.030
Li Si.

533
35:39.230 --> 35:40.030
Jiuying.

534
35:42.110 --> 35:43.640
How could you call him Li Si?

535
35:43.920 --> 35:44.920
He is Prince Xian.

536
35:44.960 --> 35:45.760
Everyone,

537
35:46.710 --> 35:49.110
there is no Prince Xian here,

538
35:49.510 --> 35:50.670
only Li Qingyang.

539
35:51.000 --> 35:53.710
I am here to discuss the case with you.

540
35:55.480 --> 35:57.140
What are the autopsy results?

541
35:57.280 --> 35:59.540
A dignified Seven-Pearl Prince like you

542
35:59.630 --> 36:01.160
still investigates cases?

543
36:02.360 --> 36:04.320
Once in the Divine Constable Bureau,

544
36:04.320 --> 36:06.520
always in the Divine Constable Bureau.

545
36:07.550 --> 36:08.960
Who would benefit the most

546
36:08.960 --> 36:11.110
from the Grand Heir Apparent's death?

547
36:11.550 --> 36:13.360
On the surface, it must be Zhou Miao,

548
36:13.360 --> 36:14.820
but I don't think it's him.

549
36:15.760 --> 36:16.550
Exactly.

550
36:17.070 --> 36:18.730
If Zhou Miao had poisoned him,

551
36:18.730 --> 36:19.920
there would be no need for him

552
36:19.920 --> 36:21.650
to carry out an assassination.

553
36:22.280 --> 36:24.080
Nor could it be the Crown Prince.

554
36:24.170 --> 36:25.230
His son is

555
36:25.230 --> 36:26.810
his biggest bargaining chip.

556
36:26.810 --> 36:29.450
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

557
36:27.000 --> 36:28.440
Even to seize the throne,

558
36:28.760 --> 36:29.920
he wouldn't go so far as

559
36:29.920 --> 36:31.280
to poison

560
36:31.360 --> 36:32.400
his only legitimate son

561
36:32.400 --> 36:34.000
just to bring down Zhou Miao.

562
36:34.360 --> 36:36.000
He merely went with the flow,

563
36:36.190 --> 36:37.000
cold-bloodedly using

564
36:37.000 --> 36:38.230
his son's death

565
36:38.360 --> 36:40.710
to lure Zhou Miao into taking a desperate risk,

566
36:40.710 --> 36:42.510
ultimately leading to his doom.

567
36:42.710 --> 36:43.630
So,

568
36:44.360 --> 36:45.760
the biggest beneficiary

569
36:46.170 --> 36:47.400
is still Liluo.

570
36:48.960 --> 36:51.160
It was the Dark Night that poisoned him.

571
36:51.920 --> 36:52.710
Now,

572
36:53.320 --> 36:54.590
Zhou Miao is dead,

573
36:54.880 --> 36:56.740
the Crown Prince has no heir left,

574
36:56.800 --> 36:58.360
and Great Shi is in turmoil.

575
36:59.280 --> 37:01.280
The only ones who want to see all this

576
37:01.590 --> 37:02.920
are the people of Liluo.

577
37:06.030 --> 37:06.840
Everyone,

578
37:07.110 --> 37:08.640
have you ever thought about

579
37:09.000 --> 37:11.330
how the Grand Heir Apparent was poisoned?

580
37:17.880 --> 37:19.150
Although the Crown Prince's residence

581
37:19.150 --> 37:20.750
is not like the inner palace,

582
37:21.070 --> 37:22.280
it's definitely not a place

583
37:22.280 --> 37:24.740
ordinary people can enter and leave at will.

584
37:24.760 --> 37:26.280
The Grand Heir Apparent's food

585
37:26.280 --> 37:28.320
was always tasted by a eunuch first.

586
37:28.760 --> 37:29.710
If it were

587
37:30.000 --> 37:31.590
a fast-acting poison,

588
37:31.920 --> 37:34.280
it wouldn't even have reached the Grand Heir Apparent's mouth.

589
37:34.280 --> 37:35.360
It must be

590
37:35.480 --> 37:37.400
a slow-acting poison

591
37:37.760 --> 37:38.800
that takes effect gradually over years

592
37:38.800 --> 37:40.000
and is hard to detect.

593
37:41.550 --> 37:42.550
In that case,

594
37:42.670 --> 37:43.760
our top priority

595
37:43.760 --> 37:45.280
is to find this poison.

596
37:45.760 --> 37:46.550
Meng Rui,

597
37:47.550 --> 37:49.360
let's go to the Underworld Market

598
37:49.360 --> 37:50.890
and ask Old Geezer about it.

599
37:51.780 --> 37:52.660
I'll go too.

600
37:52.800 --> 37:53.550
No.

601
37:54.000 --> 37:55.730
Practice martial arts with me.

602
37:56.360 --> 37:57.550
Your Highness Prince Xian,

603
37:57.550 --> 37:59.750
someone from the palace is here for you.

604
38:01.150 --> 38:01.960
Zhenzhu,

605
38:02.480 --> 38:03.760
I'll leave the trip to the Underworld Market

606
38:03.760 --> 38:05.400
to you and Meng Rui.

607
38:05.590 --> 38:06.400
Alright.

608
38:06.670 --> 38:07.830
There's something

609
38:08.480 --> 38:09.760
I must do myself.

610
38:10.200 --> 38:11.350
[Crown Prince's Residence]

611
38:11.760 --> 38:12.890
By imperial decree,

612
38:12.920 --> 38:16.050
Zhou Tiao is ordered to enter the palace for an audience.

613
38:21.230 --> 38:22.030
Me?

614
38:23.200 --> 38:24.200
Enter the palace?

615
38:25.150 --> 38:26.800
Father is on his deathbed?

616
38:29.960 --> 38:31.710
He hasn't made

617
38:31.880 --> 38:33.920
Fourth Brother Crown Prince, has he?

618
38:33.920 --> 38:35.720
Then the position is still mine.

619
38:36.760 --> 38:39.090
Father is summoning me to take the throne,

620
38:39.110 --> 38:40.080
right?

621
38:40.230 --> 38:42.440
He's summoning me to succeed him, isn't he?

622
38:42.440 --> 38:43.230
Am I right?

623
38:43.340 --> 38:45.340
I haven't received any such decree.

624
38:48.110 --> 38:49.190
It must be.

625
38:49.710 --> 38:50.750
It must be!

626
38:53.480 --> 38:54.550
I'm still the Crown Prince.

627
38:54.550 --> 38:56.080
I'm still the Crown Prince!

628
38:56.710 --> 38:58.760
So what if he's a Seven-Pearl Prince?

629
38:58.760 --> 38:59.880
The Fourth Brother is nothing!

630
38:59.880 --> 39:00.710
Servants!

631
39:01.230 --> 39:02.090
Your Highness!

632
39:02.510 --> 39:03.360
Servants!

633
39:03.360 --> 39:04.000
Your Highness!

634
39:04.000 --> 39:05.030
Servants!

635
39:05.070 --> 39:06.760
Go get Eunuch Zhao!

636
39:06.760 --> 39:08.460
Why are you looking for Eunuch Zhao,

637
39:08.460 --> 39:09.510
Your Highness?

638
39:09.510 --> 39:10.840
Have Eunuch Zhao check

639
39:10.840 --> 39:11.510
whether the Grand Heir Apparent's medicine

640
39:11.510 --> 39:12.760
is ready.

641
39:13.320 --> 39:14.670
If it's boiled too long,

642
39:14.760 --> 39:16.230
it'll lose its potency.

643
39:21.800 --> 39:22.630
Come here.

644
39:23.800 --> 39:24.760
Come here.

645
39:25.880 --> 39:27.190
Let me tell you,

646
39:27.480 --> 39:28.510
my son

647
39:28.590 --> 39:29.670
is not dead.

648
39:29.800 --> 39:31.110
He's still alive.

649
39:32.110 --> 39:32.970
Your Highness,

650
39:33.360 --> 39:34.510
the Grand Heir Apparent...

651
39:34.510 --> 39:35.230
He has already...

652
39:35.230 --> 39:36.850
He's already dead.

653
39:41.400 --> 39:42.800
He's already dead.

654
39:43.340 --> 39:44.480
He's not dead.

655
39:44.480 --> 39:45.550
He's dead.

656
39:45.550 --> 39:46.510
He's not dead!

657
39:46.510 --> 39:47.590
He's dead!

658
39:47.590 --> 39:49.480
-He's not dead! -He's dead!

659
39:49.480 --> 39:50.590
You lunatic!

660
39:50.970 --> 39:51.870
My son!

661
39:51.910 --> 39:52.760
My son!

662
39:52.760 --> 39:53.800
-Your Highness! -You're not dead!

663
39:53.800 --> 39:54.570
Your Highness!

664
39:54.570 --> 39:55.820
My son!

665
39:55.850 --> 39:56.850
I'm a lunatic?

666
39:58.660 --> 39:59.900
You're a lunatic.

667
40:01.110 --> 40:02.710
Rise. Rise.

668
40:02.880 --> 40:04.190
You may all rise!

669
40:05.710 --> 40:07.350
Help me get changed

670
40:07.510 --> 40:08.910
so I can enter the palace!

671
40:09.360 --> 40:10.630
Help me get changed!

672
40:11.350 --> 40:13.000
I need to enter the palace!

673
40:13.230 --> 40:14.230
[Succeeding Heaven, Ushering in Fortune]

674
40:16.360 --> 40:17.920
Where is the Crown Princess?

675
40:17.920 --> 40:18.760
Where is she?

676
40:18.880 --> 40:19.590
Hurry up and get dressed!

677
40:19.590 --> 40:20.920
Follow me to the palace!

678
40:21.000 --> 40:22.150
Where is the Crown Princess?

679
40:22.150 --> 40:23.510
Follow me to the palace!

680
40:26.480 --> 40:28.130
The Crown Princess has taken her own life!

681
40:28.130 --> 40:29.280
Help!

682
40:29.760 --> 40:30.620
Your Highness?

683
40:31.110 --> 40:31.970
Your Highness!

684
40:32.920 --> 40:33.780
Your Highness!

685
40:35.230 --> 40:36.230
Your Highness...

686
40:36.880 --> 40:37.740
Your Highness!

687
40:38.150 --> 40:39.910
Your Highness!

688
40:40.070 --> 40:41.320
Silly woman.

689
40:42.920 --> 40:44.510
Just one step away.

690
40:45.480 --> 40:49.280
-Your Highness. -You were just one step away from being the Empress.

691
40:50.400 --> 40:51.280
Your Highness!

692
40:54.510 --> 40:56.090
It doesn't matter.

693
40:58.780 --> 41:00.290
Hear my command!

694
41:01.470 --> 41:03.150
Follow me into the palace!

695
41:04.880 --> 41:07.000
I am going to be the Emperor.

696
41:09.980 --> 41:10.980
Your Highness!

697
41:15.120 --> 41:20.050
[Yu'an Hall]

698
41:25.410 --> 41:28.680
[Yu'an Hall]

699
41:43.660 --> 41:45.350
[Yu'an Hall]

700
41:51.850 --> 41:54.980
[Yu'an Hall]

701
41:57.680 --> 42:06.220
[Yu'an Hall]

702
42:01.760 --> 42:02.550
Zhou Yan,

703
42:02.960 --> 42:04.480
the Seven-Pearl Prince,

704
42:04.760 --> 42:06.760
is summoned for an audience!

705
42:13.510 --> 42:14.590
Impossible.

706
42:14.930 --> 42:15.900
Impossible.

707
42:16.190 --> 42:17.480
Why is it Zhou Yan?

708
42:17.510 --> 42:19.060
Father must be confused.

709
42:19.150 --> 42:20.360
I am the Crown Prince!

710
42:20.360 --> 42:22.480
-Your Highness! -I am the Crown Prince!

711
42:22.480 --> 42:23.420
Your Highness!

712
42:23.630 --> 42:25.430
Father must have made a mistake!

713
42:25.480 --> 42:26.800
-I'm the Crown Prince! -Your Highness!

714
42:26.800 --> 42:27.590
Your Highness!

715
42:27.590 --> 42:29.220
I am the Crown Prince!

716
42:30.230 --> 42:31.030
Father!

717
42:31.070 --> 42:31.630
Your Highness!

718
42:31.630 --> 42:32.920
-I'm the Crown Prince! -Your Highness!

719
42:32.920 --> 42:33.630
Father!

720
42:34.800 --> 42:36.620
I am the Crown Prince!

721
42:38.920 --> 42:39.780
Your Highness!

722
42:46.030 --> 42:48.300
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

723
42:47.550 --> 42:48.360
Yan.

724
42:48.760 --> 42:49.920
Is Yan here?

725
42:50.140 --> 42:52.270
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

726
42:51.760 --> 42:52.510
Yan.

727
42:52.510 --> 42:53.310
Your Majesty.

728
43:04.020 --> 43:04.830
Yan?

729
43:10.510 --> 43:12.920
Greetings, Father.

730
43:13.030 --> 43:13.840
Yan.

731
43:14.030 --> 43:14.760
Careful, Your Majesty.

732
43:14.760 --> 43:15.440
Yan.

733
43:17.110 --> 43:17.920
Yan!

734
43:29.880 --> 43:30.680
Your Majesty,

735
43:30.880 --> 43:32.320
I shall take my leave.

736
43:31.680 --> 43:41.030
[Where Virtue Abides, Grace Abounds]

737
43:36.510 --> 43:37.360
Father.

738
43:39.150 --> 43:40.230
Your eyes...

739
43:43.400 --> 43:44.510
I am fine.

740
43:50.150 --> 43:51.750
Your eldest brother is gone.

741
43:51.920 --> 43:53.360
Your second brother is morally corrupt

742
43:53.360 --> 43:54.670
and unfit to rule.

743
43:56.760 --> 43:59.110
Now that the remnants of Liluo are not yet eradicated,

744
43:59.110 --> 44:00.400
they will surely

745
44:01.670 --> 44:03.870
plunge Great Shi into chaos after I die.

746
44:06.890 --> 44:10.680
[Where Virtue Abides, Grace Abounds]

747
44:08.710 --> 44:09.510
Yan.

748
44:12.510 --> 44:13.360
This

749
44:14.360 --> 44:17.020
is a silk pouch your grandfather entrusted to me

750
44:17.360 --> 44:19.960
on his deathbed.

751
44:20.550 --> 44:21.880
He said if

752
44:22.360 --> 44:24.190
the people of Liluo ever return,

753
44:24.760 --> 44:26.320
it would be time to open it.

754
44:27.510 --> 44:28.360
Open it.

755
44:33.150 --> 44:33.960
Come on.

756
44:56.630 --> 44:57.440
Yan.

757
44:58.340 --> 45:07.440
[Where Virtue Abides, Grace Abounds]

758
45:01.150 --> 45:02.510
Your grandfather said

759
45:04.480 --> 45:07.410
that no matter how long the Liluo people lay dormant,

760
45:07.880 --> 45:08.800
this pouch

761
45:09.760 --> 45:11.730
would prove useful as long as

762
45:11.960 --> 45:13.440
it was passed down

763
45:14.540 --> 45:16.800
from one emperor of Great Shi to the next.

764
45:35.590 --> 45:36.400
Father.

765
45:37.510 --> 45:38.880
There's something

766
45:39.630 --> 45:40.870
I must tell you.

767
45:41.840 --> 45:42.630
Go ahead.

768
45:46.670 --> 45:47.510
I've been poisoned

769
45:47.510 --> 45:49.280
by Liluo's Chiying bug.

770
45:50.200 --> 45:51.790
My days are numbered,

771
45:53.550 --> 45:54.590
and at any moment,

772
45:54.590 --> 45:56.480
I could become their puppet.

773
45:57.590 --> 45:58.750
There's no cure

774
45:59.590 --> 46:00.800
for this poison.
